    <statement><p>Given that <m>P(114) = 59</m> and <m>P'(114) = 18</m>, approximate
<m>P(111)</m>.</p>
<p><m>P(111) \approx</m> <fillin characters="6" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>5</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><alert> Solution:</alert> 



Using the formula, <m>f(c + h) \approx f(c) + f'(c)\cdot h</m>, with 
the function <m>P</m>,
<me>P(111) = P(114  - 3) \approx P(114) + P'(114)\cdot (-3)
  = 59 + 18 \cdot (-3) = 5.</me>


</solution>
